    { q: 'Analyse and evaluate the effectiveness of the Law Commission as a method of law reform. [15]', m: 15, ms: ['expertise and independence', 'research and consultation — quality of law', 'draft Bills ready for Parliament', 'repeal of obsolete statutes', 'implementation rate about two-thirds; reports ignored (OAPA 2015)', 'lack of parliamentary time and political will', 'failure of codification', 'Law Commission Act 2009 and protocol improvements', 'comparison with judges / pressure groups', 'conclusion'] }
